; CONTINUAR - drawn in the WINDOW map ($9C00 rows 0-17) with the LCD off; window full
; screen (hud_cut = 0, WY = 0), sprites off. The stage stays untouched in the BG ($9800),
; so continuing only needs hud_cut = 1 again. Resident tiles only (font + HUD group).
; Row 0 = HUD (live values). Box rows 3-14. Countdown digit (8,9) in a 3x3 box (cols 8-10,
; rows 7-9), 9 -> 0 one per 60 f. "QUEDAN 3" = continues left. "PULSA START" blinks 30/30.
